{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51998","headline":"缺题五古诗 二 · 魏徵","name":"缺题五古诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵芝生河洲，动摇因洪波。\n兰荣一何晚，严霜瘁其柯。\n哀哉二芳草，不植泰山阿。\n文质道所贵，遭时用有嘉。\n绦灌临衡宰，谓谊崇浮华。\n贤才抑不用，远投荆南沙。\n抱玉乘龙骥，不逢乐与和。\n安得孔仲尼，爲世陈四科。\n（见上海大衆书局《古今碑帖集成》。\n）（按：诗帖爲大楷，云出静木斋藏。\n末署：「贞观三年。\n」原连作一首，详诗意及押韵，当爲二诗。\n此帖前代未见着录，静木斋亦不详爲谁，是否魏徵所作，甚爲可疑。\n今姑录出，以俟考详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51998.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51998","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}